creatures:
- name: Sprite
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 10 (rollable(dice=4d4,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Fly 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Initiative) (14)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** Common, Elvish, Sylvan  
      **Challenge** 1/4 (50 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Needle Sword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Needle Sword]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+4,dicelabel=Damage [Needle Sword]) Piercing damage.

      ***Enchanting Bow.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Enchanting Bow]), range 40/160 ft. *Hit:* 1 Piercing damage, and the target has the ***Charmed*** condition until the start of the sprite's next turn.

      ***Heart Sight.*** *Charisma Saving Throw:* DC 10, one creature within 5 feet the sprite can see (Celestials, Fiends, and Undead automatically fail the save). *Failure:* The sprite knows the target's emotions and alignment.

      ***Invisibility.*** The sprite casts [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility) on itself, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability.

      At will: [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Tiny Fey, Neutral Good*  
    **Challenge** 1/4
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024sprite
  status: 1

